<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Holderbank.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Holderbank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Holderbank Financiere Glarus AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,050 CHF		 PREMIUM	12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.5 CHF		   GEARING	14.2 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.JAN.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,000 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
